  "description": "Maximum overall size: Width: 6M (same width as our terraced house) x Depth: 5M x Height: 3M. \nA fully double-glazed PVC-u roof Low E/Part K\nA fully double-glazed PVC-u front elevation of sliding doors Low E / Part K\nPartially glazed PVC-u double-glazed side elevations Low E / Part K\nThe combination of the fully glazed front elevation and the partially glazed side elevations would ensure that the overall glazed wall area meets the requirement for at least 50% of the area to be glazed\nAll other non-glass materials will mainly consist of 1M deep concrete footings, brick damp course, damp-proof membrane, block work, insulation, plasterboard, plaster skim, tiled floor, painted walls\nHigh-grade thermal insulation within the walls and flooring to maintain a comfortable and consistent temperature throughout the year\nHigh-security multi-point locking systems on all doors and windows to provide security protection\nAny heating will be independent. There will be no plumbing. There will be electricity required for lighting and wall sockets. The existing rear door and windows will remain providing full thermal separation",
